  "statuteText": "261:74-b Qualifications and Training of Agents. –\n\nNo municipal official shall be appointed as an agent unless he and his staff meet the qualifications and successfully complete the training program established under RSA 261:74-g. No agent shall continue to be authorized to perform the duties required under this subdivision unless he and his staff continue to meet the qualification and training requirements."
